UNSUPPORTED: system-windows
XFAIL: system-darwin

A file descriptor a parent hands to its child (as make does with its
jobserver) is still open in the child through catter.
Known failures: #153 (inherited descriptors are closed on macOS).

RUN: %e2e probe pass-fds | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe pass-fds | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS pass-fds
